  { "kind": "text", "context": "", "msgid": "How much smaller, when compared to the new file, a delta-encoded patch needs to be for it to be exported.\nIf the patch is not at least this much smaller, the new file will be exported as-is.", "msgstr": "相对于新文件，增量编码补丁需要小多少才会被导出。\n如果补丁没有小到这个程度，就会按原样导出新文件。" },
  { "kind": "text", "context": "", "msgid": "If checked, any change to a file already present in the base packs will be exported as the difference between the old file and the new file.\nEnabling this comes at the cost of longer export times as well as longer load times for patched resources.", "msgstr": "若勾选，对基础包中已有文件的任何改动都会以“旧文件与新文件的差异”形式导出。\n启用此项会增加导出时间，也会增加被修补资源的加载时间。" },
